ours per week. Days Worked Flexible Hours/Shift worked Flexible Posting Detail Information Job Summary/Basic Function Safely driving university vehicles for field trips. Required Qualifications Recommendation of the supervising professor. Valid driver’s license. Successful completion of driver’s license background check through High Right Preferred Qualifications Chemistry Major or registered for the class taking the field trip. Job Duties Drive for field trips for the department. Working Conditions and Physical Effort Posting Open Date 10/05/2026 Posting Close Date 11/30/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants We encourage you to upload your class schedule, which will help us to assist you with determining the best working hours outside of your academic and extra-curricular schedule. Quicklink for Posting/Requisition https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/15690 Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application Resume Other Document 1 Class Schedule Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently attending Millersville University or will be at the time of employment? Yes No * What days/hours are you available to work? (Open Ended Question) * What is your current major/minor? (Open Ended Question) * Are you currently on Millersville University Student Payroll? YES - I have another job on campus and am in the student payroll system. IN PROCESS - I am in the process of completing new hire paperwork with the Student Payroll Office for another job on campus. No. * Do you have a driver's license? Describe your comfort level and willingness to drive a university vehicle (mini-van) for events, activities, and field trips. (Open Ended Question) To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
