    "https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/15677": {
      "title": "Student Athlete Tutor",
      "description": "Millersville University Employment Site | Student Athlete Tutor Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Links Benefits Summaries Office of Human Resources Student Athlete Tutor Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening. To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Staff Posting Details To create a Posting, first complete the information on this screen, then click the Next button or select the page in the left hand navigation menu. Proceed through all sections completing all necessary information. To submit the Posting to the next Reviewer for his/her approval, you must go to the Posting Summary Page by clicking on the Next button until you reach the Posting Summary Page or select Posting Summary Page from the left navigation menu. Once a summary page appears, hover your mouse over the orange Action button for a list of possible approval step options. Position Information Requisition Number Stu826P Position Type Student Worker Department Department of Student Workers Job Title Student Athlete Tutor Classification Student Worker Pay Rate $10.00 per hour Position Summary Information Hours per week Days Worked Hours/Shift worked Days and Evenings based on availability Posting Detail Information Job Summary/Basic Function The Athletics Department is seeking a responsible, motivated, and academically successful student to serve as a tutor for student athletes. Tutors play an important role in supporting the academic success of student athletes by providing study strategies and individualized tutoring. Required Qualifications Must be a current active student Ability to maintain confidentiality Must be dependable and responsible Clearances are required for this position: PA Criminal Background, Child Abuse, & FBI Fingerprint Preferred Qualifications Job Duties Provide one-on-one and group sessions for student-athletes in assigned subject areas. Assist student athletes with understanding course content, completing assignments, and preparing for exams. Help students develop effective study habits, note taking strategies, and time management skills. Assist with administrative tasks related to academic support services. Working Conditions and Physical Effort Posting Open Date 10/02/2026 Posting Close Date 11/13/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants Quicklink for Posting/Requisition https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/15674 Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Resume Class Schedule Optional Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application Unofficial Transcripts 1 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Are you currently on Millersville University Student Payroll? YES - I have another job on campus and am in the student payroll system. IN PROCESS - I am in the process of completing new hire paperwork with the Student Payroll Office for another job on campus. No. Are you currently attending Millersville University or will be at the time of employment? Yes No What is your current status at Millersville University? Freshman Sophmore What days/hours are you available to work? (Open Ended Question) Please list the courses you would like to tutor (e.g. Math 201). (Open Ended Question) To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
