tion or related specialized discipline. Supervisory or Administrative experience in public school settings. Prior college-level teaching experience. Essential Functions Posting Open Date 06/27/2023 Posting Close Date Quicklink for Posting/Requisition https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/10766 Applicant Documents Required Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application Curriculum Vitae Unofficial Transcripts 1 Reference Letter 1 Reference Letter 2 Optional Documents Resume Unofficial Transcripts 2 Unofficial Transcripts 3 Other Document 1 Other Document 2 Reference Letter 3 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
