to 10 hrs/week Days Worked Writing Center Hrs are M-Th 12-8PM and Fri 12-4PM Hours/Shift worked Flexible Posting Detail Information Job Summary/Basic Function Millersville University’s Writing Center is seeking a writing tutor to provide guidance with student papers, projects, and other writing-related needs. Required Qualifications Excellent written communication skills Excellent oral communication skills Ability to maintain confidentiality Computer skills (Proficiency in Microsoft Word and ability to use Zoom) Willingness to perform varied duties Ability to multitask and work with multiple projects at one time Must complete 3 required clearances (PA Criminal Background, Child Abuse History, and FBI Fingerprints). Preferred Qualifications Job Duties Responsible for guiding students’ writing Responsible for assisting students in developing writing strategies Responsible for sharing writing resources with students Work in-person, on Zoom, and online Log tutor sessions Complete chosen Writing Center specialty role Working Conditions and Physical Effort Be able to sit and use a computer for the length of shift Posting Open Date 08/12/2026 Posting Close Date 05/01/2027 Special Instructions to Applicants Previous experience is not required. We will provide training to all. Resume is required. Cover letter optional. We encourage you to upload your class schedule, which will help us to assist you with determining the best working hours during your academic and extra-curricular schedule. Quicklink for Posting/Requisition https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/15421 Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application Other Document 1 Class Schedule Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently attending Millersville University or will be at the time of employment? Yes No * What is your current major/minor? (Open Ended Question) * List any English, W, Advanced Writing, or other relevant courses you have completed with a B+ or higher: (Open Ended Question) * What are your own strengths and weaknesses as a writer? (Open Ended Question) * Why do you think you would be a good writing tutor? (Open Ended Question) * This position requires that you complete three background clearances (PA Criminal Background, Child Abuse History, and FBI Fingerprinting). If you are selected for this position, do you have the three clearances from previous employment or for educational purposes? Or would you need to complete them? (Open Ended Question) * Are you currently on Millersville University Student Payroll? YES - I have another job on campus and am in the student payroll system. IN PROCESS - I am in the process of completing new hire paperwork with the Student Payroll Office for another job on campus. No. * What days/hours are you available to work? (Open Ended Question) To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
