ntain music folder inventory. Assist with Wind Band Events as needed Working Conditions and Physical Effort * Be able to sit and use a computer for the length of shift * Be able to lift packages at most 10lbs * Be able to walk for a length of shift Posting Open Date 07/24/2026 Posting Close Date 11/30/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants Previous office experience preferred. Must be enrolled as a student in Tell School Choral Ensemble (University Choir, Women’s Choir, or Chorale) Cover letter and resume are optional. Class schedule is required which will help us to assist you with determining the best working hours during your academic and extra-curricular schedule. Quicklink for Posting/Requisition https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/15305 Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Class Schedule Optional Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application Resume Other Document 1 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently attending Millersville University or will be at the time of employment? Yes No * What days/hours are you available to work? (Open Ended Question) * What is your current major/minor? (Open Ended Question) * Are you currently on Millersville University Student Payroll? YES - I have another job on campus and am in the student payroll system. IN PROCESS - I am in the process of completing new hire paperwork with the Student Payroll Office for another job on campus. No. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
