    "https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/15194": {
      "title": "Student Worker- Club Sport Supervisor Fall 2026",
      "description": "Millersville University Employment Site | Student Worker- Club Sport Supervisor Fall 2026 Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Links Benefits Summaries Office of Human Resources Student Worker- Club Sport Supervisor Fall 2026 Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening. To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Previous experience is not required. We will provide training to all. Cover letter and resume are not required. We encourage you to upload your class schedule, which will help us to assist you with determining the best working hours during your academic and extra-curricular schedule. Please upload any current certifications to your application. Staff Posting Details To create a Posting, first complete the information on this screen, then click the Next button or select the page in the left hand navigation menu. Proceed through all sections completing all necessary information. To submit the Posting to the next Reviewer for his/her approval, you must go to the Posting Summary Page by clicking on the Next button until you reach the Posting Summary Page or select Posting Summary Page from the left navigation menu. Once a summary page appears, hover your mouse over the orange Action button for a list of possible approval step options. Position Information Requisition Number Stu764P Position Type Student Worker Department Department of Student Workers Job Title Student Worker- Club Sport Supervisor Fall 2026 Classification Student Worker Pay Rate Starting rate $10.00/hr Position Summary Information Hours per week Up to 30 hrs/week Days Worked Flexible Hours/Shift worked Flexible Posting Detail Information Job Summary/Basic Function Club Sport Supervisor No prior experience is required. All training is provided. Flexible hours based on availability. Hours will range from evenings to weekend hours primarily. Interact with club sport programs and assist with their event management, attendance, risk management, and communication with the Campus Recreation department. Required Qualifications Previous experience is not required. Must complete 3 required clearances (PA Criminal Background, Child Abuse History, and FBI Fingerprints) Preferred Qualifications Job Duties Club Sport Supervisor: Oversees the safe and efficient operation of Club Sports competitions and special events. This position serves as the on-site representative of Campus Recreation by enforcing university and Club Sports policies, assisting with facility and equipment setup, coordinating with sideline medical personnel to support participant safety, responding to emergencies, and ensuring a safe and positive environment for participants, officials, and spectators. Supervisors work closely with club officers, officials, medical personnel, and Campus Recreation professional staff to promote safety, sportsmanship, and successful event operations. Working Conditions and Physical Effort Posting Open Date 07/01/2026 Posting Close Date 12/01/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants Previous experience is not required. We will provide training to all. Cover letter and resume are not required. We encourage you to upload your class schedule, which will help us to assist you with determining the best working hours during your academic and extra-curricular schedule. Please upload any current certifications to your application. Quicklink for Posting/Requisition https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/15192 Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application Resume Other Document 1 Other Document 2 Class Schedule Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently attending Millersville University or will be at the time of employment? Yes No * What days/hours are you available to work? (Open Ended Question) * Are you available to work weekends? Yes No * What is your current major/minor? (Open Ended Question) * Do you have any current certifications? Yes No * If so, type and expiration of the certification. (Open Ended Question) * Are you a current student worker or previously worked on campus? (Open Ended Question) * Are you a current member of any club sport team? If yes, which one? (Open Ended Question) * This position requires that you complete three background clearances (PA Criminal Background, Child Abuse History, and FBI Fingerprinting). If you are selected for this position, do you have the three clearances from previous employment or for educational purposes? Or would you need to complete them? (Open Ended Question) To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
