      "title": "Student Worker- Intramural Sport Official Fall 2026",
      "description": "Millersville University Employment Site | Student Worker- Intramural Sport Official Fall 2026 Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Links Benefits Summaries Office of Human Resources Student Worker- Intramural Sport Official Fall 2026 Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening. To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Previous experience is not required. We will provide training to all. Cover letter and resume are not required. We encourage you to upload your class schedule, which will help us to assist you with determining the best working hours during your academic and extra-curricular schedule. Please upload any current certifications to your application. Staff Posting Details To create a Posting, first complete the information on this screen, then click the Next button or select the page in the left hand navigation menu. Proceed through all sections completing all necessary information. To submit the Posting to the next Reviewer for his/her approval, you must go to the Posting Summary Page by clicking on the Next button until you reach the Posting Summary Page or select Posting Summary Page from the left navigation menu. Once a summary page appears, hover your mouse over the orange Action button for a list of possible approval step options. Position Information Requisition Number Stu746P Position Type Student Worker Department Department of Student Workers Job Title Student Worker- Intramural Sport Official Fall 2026 Classification Student Worker Pay Rate Starting rate $9.00/hr Position Summary Information Hours per week Up to 30 hrs/week Days Worked Sunday - Thursday Hours/Shift worked 4pm - Midnight Posting Detail Information Job Summary/Basic Function Intramural Sports Official: No prior experience is required. All training is provided. Flexible hours based on availability. After hiring and continuous satisfactory employment, intramural employees have numerous opportunities for advancement. Required Qualifications Previous experience is not required. Must complete 3 required clearances (PA Criminal Background, Child Abuse History, and FBI Fingerprints) Preferred Qualifications Job Duties Intramural Officials help create a safe, fair, and engaging environment for intramural sports competitions. They officiate games by enforcing rules, making informed judgment calls, and maintaining control of players and spectators. Responsibilities include attending required trainings and meetings, setting up and breaking down fields or courts, and ensuring all equipment is safe and ready for play. Officials must communicate clearly with participants and staff, promote sportsmanship, and remain calm under pressure. This role requires flexibility, strong decision-making skills, and the availability to work nights. Working Conditions and Physical Effort Requires ability to work in a variety of weather conditions while maintaining a positive and professional attitude. Posting Open Date 06/01/2026 Posting Close Date 10/30/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants Previous experience is not required. We will provide training to all. Cover letter and resume are not required. We encourage you to upload your class schedule, which will help us to assist you with determining the best working hours during your academic and extra-curricular schedule. Please upload any current certifications to your application. Quicklink for Posting/Requisition https://jobs.millersville.edu/postings/15011 Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application Resume Other Document 1 Other Document 2 Class Schedule Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently attending Millersville University or will be at the time of employment? Yes No * What days/hours are you available to work? (Open Ended Question) * Are you available to work weekends? Yes No * What is your current major/minor? (Open Ended Question) * Do you have any current certifications? Yes No If so, type and expiration of the certification. (Open Ended Question) * This position requires that you complete three background clearances (PA Criminal Background, Child Abuse History, and FBI Fingerprinting). If you are selected for this position, do you have the three clearances from previous employment or for educational purposes? Or would you need to complete them? (Open Ended Question) * Are you currently on Millersville University Student Payroll? YES - I have another job on campus and am in the student payroll system. IN PROCESS - I am in the process of completing new hire paperwork with the Student Payroll Office for another job on campus. No. * What sports are you interested in officiating or have officiated in the past? (Open Ended Question) To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
